# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root (the 5 Python services).
# The wso2is image uses its own context (./wso2-is), so excluding the
# ~400 MB IS pack here does NOT affect that build — it only keeps it out of the
# Python services' build context (was 409 MB -> a few MB), speeding every build.

# Heavy / unrelated to the Python service images
wso2-is/
tempz/
docs/
platform/
.bootstrap/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vscode/

# Not needed at image-build time (provided at runtime via env_file / volumes)
config/
scripts/

# Python / editor / OS cruft
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.env
**/.DS_Store

# Docs & scratch
*.md
**/README.md
laptop_setup_guide*.md
data.txt
